    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθάλασσος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lying well by the sea</i>, <i><span class="en">
